cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If this was useful in your work, please cite it."
title: "Kakeya Conjecture Lab: an interactive lab with a box-counting dimension meter"
abstract: "An interactive exploration of the Kakeya conjecture. Its dimension meter performs genuine box counting on sets whose dimension is known, so the reader can see the estimator's own bias — large enough to show why no finite computation settles the conjecture."
type: software
authors:
